sequenceDiagram
    title Access approval and successful provisioning
    participant Employee
    participant Application
    participant Manager
    participant PolicyEngine
    participant Security
    participant DataOwner
    participant IdentityProvider

    %% EDGE: WF-01
    Employee->>Application: Submit access request
    Application->>Manager: Open manager review

    %% EDGE: WF-02
    Manager-->>Application: Approve manager review
    Application->>PolicyEngine: Evaluate request risk

    alt High risk
        %% EDGE: WF-03
        PolicyEngine-->>Application: Route high-risk request to security review
        Application->>Security: Open security review

        %% EDGE: WF-05
        Security-->>Application: Approve high-risk access
        Application->>DataOwner: Open data owner review
    else Normal risk
        PolicyEngine-->>Application: Normal risk needs no security review

        %% EDGE: WF-04
        DataOwner->>Application: Open data owner review
    end

    %% EDGE: WF-06
    DataOwner-->>Application: Approve data access
    Application->>IdentityProvider: Start provisioning

    %% EDGE: WF-07
    IdentityProvider-->>Application: Access granted and identity group synced
